OL,3,AWilliam and Kate celebrate Earthshot
OL,4,APrize winners in Mumbai
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales have
OL,7,Fsaid environmental innovators are
OL,8,Fchanging the lives of future
OL,9,Fgenerations as they celebrated this
OL,10,Fyear's winners of the Earthshot Prize.
OL,12,FFive award-winners were named at a
OL,13,Fceremony in Mumbai, India, and will
OL,14,Feach receive #1m to scale up their
OL,15,Fprojects.
OL,17,FOne of the winners was a country - with
OL,18,FBhutan being recognised for its
OL,19,Fenvironmental policies that help to
OL,20,Fsafeguard water supplies for nearly a
OL,21,Ffifth of the world's population.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
