OL,3,AWilliam and Kate celebrate Earthshot
OL,4,APrize winners in Mumbai
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndian cricket legend Sachin Tendulkar,
OL,7,Factor Rami Malek and Bollywood stars
OL,8,FAlia Bhatt and Sonam Kapoor were among
OL,9,Fthose who attended the ceremony, which
OL,10,Fsaw performances from Take That and
OL,11,FBridgerton's Simone Ashley.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
