OL,3,AJensen Huang says he would be
OL,4,A'honoured' to return as Nvidia CEO if
OL,5,Aboard asked him
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang said he would be
OL,8,F"honoured" to return as the boss of
OL,9,Ftech giant Nvidia if the board asked
OL,10,Fhim to, in his first public comments
OL,11,Fsince his shock resignation.
OL,13,F"I created problems for the Board that
OL,14,FI deeply regret. I own my mistakes
OL,15,Fcompletely," Huang said on X, days
OL,16,Fafter reports he had extramarital
OL,17,Faffairs, including with an alleged
OL,18,FChinese spy.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
